度の特別損失に計上することといたしました。以上の結果、2026年３月期の通期連結業績予想を上記のとおり修正いたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2025年5月15日公表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 20, "20.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 3, "3.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 3, "3.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 0, "0.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 14, "14.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 14, "14.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社は、成長投資及び有利子負債の返済とのバランスを勘案し、配当性向30％を目安に株主還元を実施することを基本方針としております。　当該方針及び2026年３月期の通期業績見通し等を踏まえ、誠に遺憾ではありますが、期末配当を前回予想の１株当たり20円00銭から３円00銭に修正いたします。株主の皆様には深くお詫び申し上げますとともに、早期の業績回復及び復配水準の向上に努めてまいります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd",